{"nodes": [{"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "label": "Stellar Assets (Classic)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Stellar Assets (Classic)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prefer classic assets over custom contract tokens unless custom logic is required. They are built in, cheaper than contract calls, and already work with wallets, exchanges, anchors, and the DEX order book. Use separate issuing and distribution accounts. For a fixed supply, lock the issuer by setting master weight to 0, because a payment from an unlocked issuer is a mint."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_trustlines", "label": "Trustlines", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Trustlines", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Credit assets require a trustline; native XLM does not. ChangeTrust with limit 0 deletes a trustline only when the balance is exactly 0, open DEX offers that create buying liabilities are cancelled, and no liquidity pool still references the asset. Match the asset by code and issuer. op_invalid_limit means balance or buying liabilities remain; op_cannot_delete means a pool still uses the trustline."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sac", "label": "Stellar Asset Contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Stellar Asset Contract (SAC)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SAC is the interop layer that exposes a classic asset to smart contracts as a SEP-41 token. The contract id is derived with Asset.contractId. Prefer a thin SAC admin that calls mint, burn, and clawback over a fully custom token when SAC can express the behavior. The admin starts as the issuer, and only the current admin can authorize the first set_admin, so call set_admin before locking the issuer. Locking first leaves the admin as the locked issuer forever. An unlocked issuer can mint outside the contract and bypass the role model."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sep41", "label": "SEP-41", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SAC vs Custom Token Interface", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Standard contract token interface: balance, transfer, approve, allowance, decimals, name, and symbol. Classic issuance stays the default; SEP-41 contract tokens are the custom-logic alternative."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_custom_contract_tokens", "label": "Custom Contract Tokens", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "When to Use What", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Last resort when SAC cannot express the behavior: complex transfer logic, custom authorization, non-standard tokens, custom DeFi integration, or NFTs and semi-fungible tokens. Royalties, fees, and transfer restrictions can often stay on a classic asset plus a SAC admin contract so DEX, anchors, wallets, and trustlines still work."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_issuer_flags", "label": "Issuer Authorization Flags", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Asset Flags", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AUTH_REQUIRED means a trustline needs approval before the holder can receive tokens. AUTH_REVOCABLE lets the issuer freeze balances. AUTH_IMMUTABLE makes the flags permanent. AUTH_CLAWBACK_ENABLED allows clawback. If revocable and clawback are both set, confirm the issuer master key weight is 0 and identify who holds the SAC admin roles before listing the asset. A contract admin does not remove the issuer's power while the master key can still sign."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_clawback", "label": "Clawback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Clawback Tokens", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Issuer operation that pulls tokens back from an account. It requires AUTH_CLAWBACK_ENABLED. Treat assets with clawback enabled cautiously."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sep0001", "label": "SEP-0001", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SEP-0001 (stellar.toml)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Publish asset metadata in /.well-known/stellar.toml under [[CURRENCIES]]. A missing home_domain or CURRENCIES entry is not evidence of a scam. Validate by issuer and SAC derivation, not by the presence of stellar.toml."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sep0010", "label": "SEP-0010", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SEP-0010 (Web Authentication)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Web authentication with a Stellar account: the server issues a challenge transaction, the client signs it with a wallet, and the server checks the signature."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sep0024", "label": "SEP-0024", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SEP-0024 (Hosted Deposit/Withdrawal)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hosted deposit and withdrawal for fiat on- and off-ramps. An interactive webview where the anchor handles KYC and the fiat transfer."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sep0045", "label": "SEP-0045", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SEP-0045 (Web Auth for Contract Accounts)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extends SEP-10 to contract accounts (C... addresses). Draft status. Required for smart-wallet and passkey-based anchor integrations; verify the current status before relying on it."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sep0050", "label": "SEP-0050", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SEP-0050 (Non-Fungible Tokens)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Draft contract interface for NFTs on Stellar, with Base, Consecutive, and Enumerable reference implementations. Verify the current status before relying on it."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_usdt0", "label": "USDT0", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "When to Use What", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Production classic asset USDT0:GATISXX6BZ6NC7IKQBY37CJD4SOZL3CYZJWXEDG6JVIY4WBS6KXJHN6Q whose SAC admin is a role-gated contract. The admin forwards mint, clawback, set_authorized, and set_admin. A cross-chain bridge holds only the minter role. It ships with no stellar.toml."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_cap0038", "label": "CAP-0038", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Remove Trustline", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defines liquidity_pool_use_count. A trustline with that count above 0 cannot be deleted until the pool position is withdrawn."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_soroban_sdk", "label": "soroban-sdk", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Using SAC in Smart Contracts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rust contract SDK. A contract calls a SAC through soroban_sdk token::Client, which uses the standard token interface."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_openzeppelin_stellar_contracts", "label": "OpenZeppelin Stellar Contracts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SEP-0050 (Non-Fungible Tokens)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reference NFT implementations for SEP-50: Base, Consecutive, and Enumerable. Repository OpenZeppelin/stellar-contracts."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_friendbot", "label": "Friendbot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Create Issuing Account", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Testnet faucet at https://friendbot.stellar.org used to fund new accounts such as a separate issuer and distributor. Mainnet has no Friendbot."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_claimable_balances", "label": "Claimable Balances", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Remove Trustline", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A wallet display entry or a claimable balance is not a trustline. Remove claimable balances by claiming them or clawing them back, not with ChangeTrust."}, {"id": "agents_skills_assets_skill_liquidity_pool_shares", "label": "Liquidity Pool Shares", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Asset Types", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Asset type that represents a liquidity-pool position. Withdraw the position and remove the pool-share trustline before deleting an asset trustline the pool still uses."}], "edges": [{"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_assets_skill_trustlines", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Stellar Assets (Classic)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_assets_skill_issuer_flags", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Asset Flags", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_assets_skill_sac", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Stellar Asset Contract (SAC)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_assets_skill_custom_contract_tokens", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "When to Use What", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_assets_skill_friendbot", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Create Issuing Account", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_dapp_skill_stellar_sdk", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Asset Identifiers", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_assets_skill_stellar_assets", "target": "agents_skills_dapp_skill_horizon", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/assets/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Create Issuing Account", 